<title>GREECE: OTE UNION CALLS 24-HR STRIKE IN EARLY MAY.</title>
<headline>OTE UNION CALLS 24-HR STRIKE IN EARLY MAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTE telecom's main union OME-OTE plans a warning 24-hour strike in the first two weeks of May, pressing for a &quot;satisfactory collective wage agreement&quot; in 1997, it said in a statement. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
